### Tests 

@Meetly_HostAddress = http://localhost:5164

GET {{Meetly_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
### List meetups
GET {{Meetly_HostAddress}}/api/meetups
Accept: application/json

### Create a development test meetup
POST {{Meetly_HostAddress}}/api/meetups
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "C# study meetup",
  "description": "Practice APIs together.",
  "place": "Campus",
  "time": "2026-10-28T14:00:00",
  "maxCapacity": 10,
  "hostId": d
}

### Register user 3 for meetup 1
POST {{Meetly_HostAddress}}/api/meetups/1/register/3
Accept: application/json

### Cancel user 3's attendance at meetup 1
DELETE {{Meetly_HostAddress}}/api/meetups/1/register/3